# Files Widget — 5 Design Suggestions

Mockups for the dashboard **Files** widget. Today it ships two variants
(`list`, `gallery`) over the attachment shape `{ filename, mimeType,
sizeBytes, createdBy, createdAt, archivedAt }`, scoped `instance | concept
| org`, with `sort`, `fileType`, `limit`, `allowUpload`. Each design below
notes what it reuses vs. what new config it needs.

Legend: `[↓]`=download `[⊟]`=archive `[✕]`=delete `◔`=uploader avatar

---

## 1 — Dense List (refined `variant:"list"`)

Information-dense rows. Type glyph + name link, a single meta line, uploader
avatar, hover-revealed actions. Best for tall/narrow boxes and "just the
files" sidebars.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Files                                        ⌄ newest  │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 📄  Q2-forecast.pdf                                    │
│     2.4 MB · 3d ago · ◔ Kalle          [↓] [⊟] [✕]     │
│ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────    │
│ 🖼  hero-shot.png                                      │
│     880 KB · 5d ago · ◔ Mara           [↓] [⊟] [✕]     │
│ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────    │
│ 📊  metrics.xlsx                                       │
│     14 KB · 1w ago · ◔ Kalle           [↓] [⊟] [✕]     │
│ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────    │
│ 📦  build-2071.zip                                     │
│     61 MB · 2w ago · ◔ ci-bot          [↓] [⊟] [✕]     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reuses:** existing `list` variant + `arrangeFiles()`.
- **New:** nothing required — this is a CSS polish of what exists.

