## 3 — Upload Hero + Recent Strip (new `variant:"upload"`)

Upload-first. A large drop target dominates; a horizontal strip of the most
recent files sits beneath. For "drop your file here" workflows on an
instance (contracts, submissions, receipts). Only meaningful at
`scope:"instance"` with `allowUpload`.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Attachments                                            │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│   ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════╗    │
│   ║                    ⬆                           ║    │
│   ║        Drop files here, or click to browse     ║    │
│   ║              PDF · PNG · DOCX · …              ║    │
│   ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════╝    │
│                                                        │
│   Recent                                               │
│   ┌────┐ ┌────┐ ┌────┐ ┌────┐ ┌────┐    4 more →       │
│   │ 📄 │ │ 🖼 │ │ 📊 │ │ 📄 │ │ 📦 │                   │
│   └────┘ └────┘ └────┘ └────┘ └────┘                   │
│   q2.pdf hero  metr.  spec  src                        │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reuses:** `FileDropZone`, `arrangeFiles()` for the strip.
- **New:** `variant:"upload"`; strip count derives from `limit` (default 5).

