## 4 — Grouped by Type (new `variant:"grouped"`)

Collapsible sections, one per file class, each with a count and aggregate
size. Turns the existing `fileType` filter into an always-on grouping. Great
for org/concept scope where mixed file kinds pile up.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Files                                    18 · 142 MB   │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ⌄ 🖼  Images            7 files · 9.1 MB               │
│     hero.png · map@2x.png · logo.svg · banner.jpg …    │
│                                                        │
│ ⌄ 📄  Documents         5 files · 22 MB                │
│     spec.docx · brief.pdf · notes.md · sow.pdf …       │
│                                                        │
│ › 📊  Spreadsheets      3 files · 0.4 MB               │
│                                                        │
│ › 📦  Other             3 files · 110 MB               │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reuses:** the `image|pdf|doc|other` classifier already in `files.ts`.
- **New:** `variant:"grouped"`; per-section collapse state (client-only,
  or persisted as `collapsedGroups`).

