## 5 — Timeline Feed (new `variant:"timeline"`)

Chronological buckets (Today / Yesterday / Earlier) rendered as an
activity stream — who added what, when. Reads like a log rather than a
file manager; pairs well with `sort:"newest"` and org scope for "what's
landing across the workspace."

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Files                                        activity  │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ TODAY                                                  │
│  ◔ Kalle  added  📄 Q2-forecast.pdf   2.4 MB   3h      │
│  ◔ Mara   added  🖼 hero-shot.png     880 KB   5h      │
│                                                        │
│ YESTERDAY                                              │
│  ◔ ci-bot added  📦 build-2071.zip    61 MB    1d      │
│                                                        │
│ EARLIER                                                │
│  ◔ Kalle  added  📊 metrics.xlsx      14 KB    1w      │
│  ◔ Mara   added  📄 spec.docx         96 KB    2w      │
│           ⊟ archived  old-draft.pdf            2w      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reuses:** `createdAt` / `createdBy`; `archivedAt` surfaces as a feed line.
- **New:** `variant:"timeline"`; date-bucketing helper.

---

## At a glance

| # | Name           | variant     | New config            | Best for                  |
|---|----------------|-------------|-----------------------|---------------------------|
| 1 | Dense List     | `list`*     | —                     | narrow boxes, sidebars    |
| 2 | Gallery Grid   | `gallery`*  | `thumbSize`           | image-heavy concepts      |
| 3 | Upload Hero    | `upload`    | (uses `limit`)        | instance drop workflows   |
| 4 | Grouped        | `grouped`   | `collapsedGroups`     | mixed org/concept piles   |
| 5 | Timeline       | `timeline`  | date-bucket helper    | org-wide "what's new"     |

\* = polish of an existing variant; 3–5 = new `variant` literals on the
contract's `Files` widget.
